# KingsLive environment

Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. Never commit secrets.

## Supabase (CTROOM + Vault)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
```

## Sanity (Blog + Studio)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=n31jvc6a
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_API_VERSION=2025-11-12
SANITY_API_TOKEN=
```

## Email (contact form + CTROOM magic links)
```
BREVO_API_KEY=
CONTACT_EMAIL_RECIPIENT=
```

## AI (Milo — optional for portfolio-only)
```
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
```

## Search / GitHub / Finance (optional)
```
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CX=
GITHUB_TOKEN=
TELLER_APPLICATION_ID=
TELLER_PRIVATE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_TELLER_APPLICATION_ID=
```
